{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>前香港奧運泳手暨凝動大使方力申（Alex）領銜的「凝動全城 破浪傳承：方力申港澳慈善游2026」今晨（21日）正式啟航，方力申於清晨8時53分由香港大嶼山雞翼角下水，挑戰橫渡長達35公里的港澳公海海域，經過連番奮力破浪後，他在下午5時半到達終點，以8小時37分24秒完成，不但較預期快約20分鐘，更打破歷年紀錄！</p><figure><img alt=\"方力申（Alex）挑戰35公里港澳橫渡。（大會提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200876977276325888804136.jpeg/WrmbeEojS80yiXf1wX-7v-8hbN-8SpidhkBbz4ZAW88\"/><figcaption>方力申（Alex）挑戰35公里港澳橫渡。（大會提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"家人到場支持！（大會提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200876982829846528703629.jpeg/hUyCcPCilfSbj1NtgHfEeP_71nCHNexVh6Jd_oeiXf4\"/><figcaption>家人到場支持！（大會提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"為慈善出力！（大會提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200876987636781056741590.jpeg/F8fpxnUqzpVg6n-cau2nP_v_zpFKzZu2KiF-1iohftY\"/><figcaption>為慈善出力！（大會提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"全程進行網上實況直播。（大會提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200876980338298880829061.jpeg/e2m9v5bunyZVYM91iTxUf4ouHaW7SFMVr2mXma9pl5k\"/><figcaption>全程進行網上實況直播。（大會提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"奮力游向終點！（大會提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200876977595092992210634.jpeg/RoDteGvU59zQIXU1hCFxF27oCuJz-gFKUVUUkVFVFJE\"/><figcaption>奮力游向終點！（大會提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"上水一刻！（大會提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200920164388835328589236.jpeg/OdXLDzTyRBhvhZCkJCRheBkj__nSLWSlGgsEGBoLBBg\"/><figcaption>上水一刻！（大會提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"挑戰成功！（大會提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200883730189651968710594.jpeg/2kjl0aVCWeCDK4tmsLR4yn8tNEPtMQb7nXewIZ13sCE\"/><figcaption>挑戰成功！（大會提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"破紀錄完成！（大會提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200883595342778368895237.jpeg/HEzKEVQWMRrv-3QjSUnwCiGtU6e-OuJHP9j6nT_Y-p0\"/><figcaption>破紀錄完成！（大會提供）</figcaption></figure><p>方力申登岸後無縫直奔開騷　台上獻唱中氣十足狀態驚人</p><p>在體能消耗至極限後，方力申今晚（21日）未有停下腳步，更上演「無縫接力」，親身趕赴「澳門百老匯」百老匯舞台出席《浪接•浪》港澳群星慈善音樂會，聯同胡定欣、側田、尹光、林盛斌（BOB）、江若琳等眾星齊心為慈善開唱。有現場網民在社交平台Threads上載演出短片，只見剛剛在冰冷海水中游足逾8個半小時的方力申，換上型格演出服站上舞台中央，手持咪高峰投入獻唱，全程中氣十足、咬字清晰流暢，完全看不出剛經歷完極限體能挑戰，鐵人般的驚人狀態令現場觀眾及網民嘆為觀止，紛紛感嘆：「真心癲」、「真心respect，好勁！」</p><figure><img alt=\"方力申無縫直奔開騷。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200915152703590400840751.png/_QBolOPimS9NYOaw9tv5USPpYilGTFJNJaQH7CWkB-w\"/><figcaption>方力申無縫直奔開騷。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"為慈善開唱。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200915149981356032756312.png/eXaanUrwOq6iRfJ3JAeFRS6dzRnIASv3rYOFaK2DhWg\"/><figcaption>為慈善開唱。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"投入獻唱。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200915147686940672190743.png/Oq2aukgKLuQzBw6CuH3GZb2rv1KXbQUdMnStFDJ0rRQ\"/><figcaption>投入獻唱。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中氣十足零疲態！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200915145254113280240819.png/YPf23UMwD6egDatVyE2G3QRGrPU-i5alFg375BYN--Q\"/><figcaption>中氣十足零疲態！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"狀態驚人！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200915142821285888379025.png/owJCwaZSEW7nle-ywwAM5zWgj5zBlc3Gdf4ITHX-CEw\"/><figcaption>狀態驚人！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T13:23:57.057429+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":629,"images":13,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T12:56:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T14:18:07.947033+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T13:17:26.776686+00:00","content_hash":"80f4572ceefca6e5cb54d1c0bb2d3b2db8c771de5069059b30a01d9857de61db","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}